  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide 3 Dairy Cows For Milk To Tanzanian orphans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide 3 milk cows to the Mwaji Secondary School in Tanzania. This school educates orphans to give them opportunities to have a better life. These cows will provide milk to the students. Due to persistent rural poverty with drought, food shortages, and and lack of available milk,  it is difficult to source milk for the students. Having dairy cows provides a consistent source of necessary nutrition for the orphan students so they are able to concentrate in learning at school.</narrative>
  </description>
